# ==============================================================================
# 🇸🇴 Tusaalaha Hawlaha Dabiiciga ah: hawshu waa & qabo hawshan
# Exact Natural Function Syntax in Koor
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Qeexidda hawsha (Function Definition)
hawshu waa ("iskudhufasho ")
(x*y)

# 2. Toos u wicidda hawsha (Direct function call statement)
# Waxay si toos ah u xisaabinaysaa 12 * 3 waxayna soo saaraysaa 36!
qabo hawshan ("iskudhufasho") (12, 3)

# 3. Natiijada oo lagu keydiyo doorsoome (Call & assign to variable)
natiijo waa qabo hawshan ("iskudhufasho") (10, 5).
waxaad soo saartaa "Natiijada 10 * 5 waa: {natiijo}".

# 4. Hawl xisaabinaysa saddex doorsoome (Function with 3 variables)
hawshu waa ("wadarta_saddex")
(a + b + c)

qabo hawshan ("wadarta_saddex") (10, 20, 30)
